{
  "id": "star-rupture-example",
  "name": "Star Rupture (Example)",
  "version": "Early Access (Jan 2026)",
  "description": "Example sandbox modeling a documented subset of Star Rupture's production chain: Titanium/Wolfram/Calcium ore and Helium-3 extraction through Smelter, Fabricator, and Furnace processing, as listed on the Star Rupture Wiki (starrupture.wiki.gg) building pages as of January 2026. Deeper Assembler-tier recipes (Accumulator, Condenser, Electromagnet, Laser Emitter, Pressure Tank, Resonator) are intentionally omitted because several of their ingredients (Battery, Pump, Valve, Generator, Liquid Helium, Synthetic Resin, Nanofibre, Electromagnetic Coil, Lens, Sulfuric Acid) have no documented producing recipe yet — adding them would break referential integrity. Verify exact numbers against the Star Rupture Wiki before relying on them, as this is an Early Access game subject to balance changes.",
